---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_NAMES } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Contact – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Write to the publisher of Prix PAC: report an outdated grant scale, a wrong energy price, a question on the calculation method, or embed the heat pump calculator." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Contact' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>One address, read every week: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. There is no phone line and we call nobody back: this site sells nothing, passes no request to any installer and makes no quotes.</p>
    <h2>Report an error</h2>
    <p>For a scale (MaPrimeRénov’, income ceilings, CEE sheet, Coup de pouce), attach the official text or page that contradicts it, with its date. For an energy price, give the source and the period. For a calculation, paste the calculator’s share link: it carries your choices, nothing else. The procedure is set out in the <a href={route('editorial', lang)}>editorial policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>What we cannot do</h2>
    <p>We file no applications, cannot see the status of your Anah request and recommend no firm. For your application, use the official MaPrimeRénov’ website; for free, neutral advice, a France Rénov’ adviser. To check that a firm is RGE-certified, the public France Rénov’ directory is the reference.</p>
    <h2>Embed the calculator</h2>
    <p>Consumer associations, local newsrooms, energy advice centres: the calculator can be embedded free of charge in an iframe. The code is on the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>Embed the calculator</a> page.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>{AUTHOR_NAME} is responsible for Prix PAC’s content; full identity in the <a href={route('terms', lang)}>legal notice</a>. Page reviewed on {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
